    {
      "text": "City of San Jose permit SPA20-012-01 (Special Use Permit/Amendment, folder year 2025), status Approved, issue date 2026-04-29: \"Special Use Permit Amendment to modify an existing permit (File No. SP20-012) to allow changes to Site B, the affordable housing building, including a reduction in vehicle parking spaces from 51 spaces to 44 spaces, an increase in bike parking from 75 to\" (city text cut off at 255 characters)",
